OL,3,GNEWSANew figures reveal total paid by
OL,4,Aprivate patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew figures reveal Jersey's health
OL,7,Fdepartment raised more than #7m by
OL,8,Fcharging patients to be treated
OL,9,Fprivately in 2025 - an increase of 22%
OL,10,Fon the previous year.
OL,12,FAnd the department appears on track to
OL,13,Fmake yet more money from private
OL,14,Fpatients this year, according to data
OL,15,Ffor the first six months of 2026.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
