OL,3,GNEWSANew figures reveal total paid by
OL,4,Aprivate patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite this, the Health and Care
OL,7,FJersey Advisory Board was this week
OL,8,Ftold income from private patients had
OL,9,Fnot increased in line with targets - in
OL,10,Fpart, due to the closure of operating
OL,11,Ftheatres "in the extreme heat
OL,12,Fexperienced during May".
OL,14,FA 2024 strategy confirmed the
OL,15,Fgovernment's aim to "significantly"
OL,16,Fincrease income from private patients
OL,17,Fby 2028, to help fund public healthcare
OL,18,Fservices.
